<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were $1.00 higher.</p>
<p>Steers - select to mostly choice 2-4 1100-1325 lbs 70.50-72.00. Select 68.00-70.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - mainly choice 2-4 1100-1250 lbs 70.50-72.00. Select, some lots with choice or commerical 65.00-70.00.</p>
</text>
